# Architecture Rules

All implementations must respect architectural boundaries.

Preferred architecture:

Presentation
|
Application
|
Domain
|
Infrastructure


Rules:

- Domain logic must not depend on frameworks.
- Dependencies must point inward.
- Use interfaces between layers.
- Avoid circular dependencies.
- Keep modules cohesive.

Before creating a new module:

Check:

- Existing modules
- Standards
- Knowledge base

